  "details": "Movement in VRChat is very jarring with how you go from 0 to 100 as soon as you touch the thumbstick, combined with how fast you move to begin with. It's very unemmersive because real people take a second or two to accelerate to a full sprint.\nI think there should be an option to add some acceleration on the ground, possibly a range with a slider. That way, the movement can feel much more natural, and fine adjustment will become easier. For those that don't like it, it's completley optional.",
